        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "32 Farmhill Road – Spacious Four-Bedroom Family Home\r\n\r\n32 Farmhill Road is a substantial four-bedroom semi-detached family home, extending to approximately 142.3 sq m, and occupying an enviable position on one of the area's most prestigious and sought-after residential roads.\r\n\r\nBehind the attractive front porch, a welcoming entrance hall leads to the principal living accommodation. To the right is a comfortable sitting room, while to the rear is an impressive large living/dining room, providing an excellent space for family life and entertaining, with direct access to the magnificent rear garden.\r\n\r\nAlso off the entrance hall is a well-appointed kitchen, together with a separate utility room and Guest WC, offering the practical accommodation expected of a substantial family home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property continues to impress with four well-proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom and a separate WC. The generous proportions throughout, combined with the excellent floor area, make this an ideal home for a growing family.The attic is particularly large, offering an excellent additional space and a significant bonus for anyone considering making further use of the area or potentially converting it, subject to the necessary planning permission and building regulations. Its generous proportions provide exciting scope for a future owner to explore the possibilities and further enhance the home. \r\n\r\nOne of the property's standout features is the large rear garden, offering an exceptional amount of outdoor space and providing a wonderful setting for family life, entertaining and enjoying the outdoors. Off-street parking to the front further enhances the practicality of the property.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nFarmhill Road is a highly regarded residential address, with an exceptional range of amenities within easy reach. Dundrum Town Centre is close by, offering an extensive selection of shops, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and services.\r\n\r\nThe area is also renowned for its excellent choice of schools, with some of Dublin's most highly regarded educational institutions nearby, including Mount Anville, St Killian's, Our Lady's Grove, Goatstown Educate Together, Alexandra College and Gonzaga.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the LUAS is within walking distance, while the area is also exceptionally well served by number 11 bus routes. The M50 and N11 are both readily accessible, providing convenient connections throughout Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nA substantial family home in a prestigious location, 32 Farmhill Road offers generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and superb access to amenities, transport links and some of Dublin's finest schools.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser."
      },
